{"tmdb":1061821,"tagline":"","synopsis":"1845, Seville, a pulsating town of sailors and small-time crooks. Teenage Salvador, assistant to the gifted knife grinder Antonio, encounters a captivating young gypsy woman, Carmen. Her stunning beauty and independent spirit set the town abuzz, but Antonio's mystical ability to glimpse the future in sharpened blades foretells a tragic fate for Carmen at the hands of a soldier, José. With unwavering resolve, Salvador musters an eclectic band of misfit street kids, led by the spirited Belén, to challenge the unyielding threads of destiny and protect Carmen from inevitable doom.","directors":[{"name":"Sébastien Laudenbach","id":1459972}],"cast":[{"actor":"Camélia Jordana","role":"Carmen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1yk7yArcgxOzN5OdUoPc8ZNvtAl.jpg","tmdb":1171510},{"actor":"Milo Machado-Graner","role":"Salva","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wdpeIXaFvSSAJq88dv6Ofzgscd7.jpg","tmdb":3302971},{"actor":"Soumaye Bocoum","role":"Belén","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bDnie8rll1Uwrq7WYuKAK4SUCMR.jpg","tmdb":1366955},{"actor":"Carl Malapa","role":"José","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sMavnd5U6ZlZYf4h3gW6T7JinZm.jpg","tmdb":1835130},{"actor":"Fehdi Bendjima","role":"L’otrac","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5G0zND2qXLawXQHqJHvwptZ7RcG.jpg","tmdb":3065885}],"trailers":[{"key":"BMBvGNsw6sE","name":"VIVA CARMEN Trailer | TIFF 2026","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-08-04"}],"official":"https://folivari.com/en/projet/love-is-a-gypsy-child-a-carmen-story","watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/iQi9sswCkXsaY30eG3eMZj93hqC.jpg",1000,1500]],"backdrops":[["/ouMmBgmmKOBmUrg710D785ZWCGG.jpg",3840,2160],["/cfja63mv8t53G8YQQ0oSwhZjVQi.jpg",3840,2160],["/56zsnCNzxyGX8Ll3tDTzQ96DAzE.jpg",3840,2160],["/fvrfP0bFuSpgOmy4lIkoSnf3Qdd.jpg",3840,2160],["/bhLilcVA9Y2HKDVCQNnGZCgdF99.jpg",3840,2160],["/smLCoIlouTlvjHerhFvKtMgfSDs.jpg",3840,2160],["/vG38L80EPh5Eb5IyYAZpfG4vEec.jpg",1280,720]],"logos":[]}}